{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41956","headline":"和夏侯秀才春日见寄 · 李中","name":"和夏侯秀才春日见寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"绵蛮黄鸟不堪听，触目离愁怕酒醒。\n云散碧山当晚槛，雨催青藓匝春庭。\n寻芳懒向桃花坞，垂钓空思杜若汀。\n昼梦不成吟有兴，挥毫书在枕边屏。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李中","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41956.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41956","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}